{"id":"920841c1841d30c3","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems.md","title":"The Book’s P.E. and P.A. Systems","display":"df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems — The Book’s P.E. and P.A. Systems","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems"],"display":"df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems — The Book’s P.E. and P.A. Systems","source":"第 III 章 pp. 28–30；第 IV 章 pp. 40、49（PDF 45–47、57、66）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms]]","[[92-df-smullyan-induction]]","[[92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-formal-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems — The Book’s P.E. and P.A. Systems"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 28–30；第 IV 章 pp. 40、49（PDF 45–47、57、66）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a9f2cffd9da7a09c\" href=\"?note=a9f2cffd9da7a09c\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms\">92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"634d28e30ada0b29\" href=\"?note=634d28e30ada0b29\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-induction\">92-df-smullyan-induction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc67eebb6ab0c5ba\" href=\"?note=fc67eebb6ab0c5ba\" title=\"92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic\">92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_E,\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J},\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J},\\mathrm{Ind}_{E,J}\">\\(\\Sigma_E,\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J},\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J},\\mathrm{Ind}_{E,J}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_r\">\\(N_r\\)</span> 采用上述原书节点。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_E=\\{1,2,3\\},J_A=\\{1,2\\}\">\\(J_E=\\{1,2,3\\},J_A=\\{1,2\\}\\)</span>；系统三元组约定见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J},\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J},\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PE}},\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\">\\(\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J},\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J},\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PE}},\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\)</span> 为下文引入的规则集、公理集和系统名。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}pe\\text{-}pa\\text{-}systems}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\langle F,F\\supset H\\rangle,H):F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\langle F\\rangle,\\forall v_i^E F):F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J},i\\geq1\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PE}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_E}\\cup\\{N_1,\\ldots,N_{11}\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{E,J_E},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\{N_1,\\ldots,N_9\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{E,J_A},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PE}_E&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_E,\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PE}},\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_E}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_E}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}_A&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_E,\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}pe\\text{-}pa\\text{-}systems}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\langle F,F\\supset H\\rangle,H):F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\langle F\\rangle,\\forall v_i^E F):F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J},i\\geq1\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PE}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_E}\\cup\\{N_1,\\ldots,N_{11}\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{E,J_E},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\{N_1,\\ldots,N_9\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{E,J_A},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PE}_E&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_E,\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PE}},\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_E}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_E}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}_A&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_E,\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>共同底层字母表仍取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_E\">\\(\\Sigma_E\\)</span>，但 P.A. 的公理和规则实例全部在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_A\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_A\\)</span> 中，因而其证明也只含无指数公式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\">\\(\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\)</span> 分别是原书 P.E./P.A. 的本地名称；它们不是旧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，也不是第 XI 章的模态 G。</p>\n<p>十九个 P.E. 公理模式是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1\">\\(L_1\\)</span>–<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_7\">\\(L_7\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_1\">\\(N_1\\)</span>–<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_{11}\">\\(N_{11}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_{12}\">\\(N_{12}\\)</span>（归纳）；P.A. 有十七个。所有连接词缩写必须先展开为有限字符串。保留旧 G 支线，未声称已经构造两种呈现之间的字符级证明翻译。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"a9f2cffd9da7a09c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-induction","status":"resolved","id":"634d28e30ada0b29","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-induction]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"fc67eebb6ab0c5ba","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formal-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J_E=\\{1,2,3\\},J_A=\\{1,2\\}$；系统三元组约定见 [[92-df-formal-system]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma_E,\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J},\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J},\\mathrm{Ind}_{E,J}","display":false},{"tex":"N_r","display":false},{"tex":"J_E=\\{1,2,3\\},J_A=\\{1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J},\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J},\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PE}},\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}pe\\text{-}pa\\text{-}systems}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J}&\\coloneqq\\{(\\langle F,F\\supset H\\rangle,H):F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J}&\\coloneqq\\{(\\langle F\\rangle,\\forall v_i^E F):F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{E,J},i\\geq1\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PE}}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_E}\\cup\\{N_1,\\ldots,N_{11}\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{E,J_E},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\{N_1,\\ldots,N_9\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_{E,J_A},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PE}_E&\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_E,\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PE}},\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_E}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_E}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}_A&\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_E,\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"L_1","display":false},{"tex":"L_7","display":false},{"tex":"N_1","display":false},{"tex":"N_{11}","display":false},{"tex":"N_{12}","display":false}],"bytes":2257,"backlinks":[{"id":"906680bfce5f44c0","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 Generalization 同样是无假设的定理级规则。本文输入采用 Fml_G；原书 Fml_E/Fml_A 上的精确规则见 [[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]。"},{"id":"16613851c4bce386","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本文与原书 Rule 1 的前提次序一致；原书规则在其字符文法上使用 ⊃，完整系统见 [[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]。"},{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 $\\mathcal L_E$ 的字符表、13 进位编码、包裹实例与对角码由[[92-df-smullyan-alphabet]]至[[92-df-smullyan-binary-wrapper]]另行记载。它们给出原书的编码机制；此前修订已在 [[92-df-smullyan-terms]]、[[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]、[[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]、[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]] 独立补齐原书语法、公理和编码，保留旧 G 支线。没有构造两种字符呈现之间的完整证明翻译，也没有提供机器核验。"},{"id":"5efcbe99d24a5bd9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 P.E. 只有二前提 MP 和一前提 Gen；本文给一般有限前提空间。原书两个具体规则集已在 [[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]] 逐项定义。"},{"id":"7a63648901cbcd33","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8ee662ea7161b3d7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A},N_1,\\ldots,N_9,\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A},\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A}$ 见 [[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]；全部公式在 $\\mathrm{Fml}_A$ 中。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-logical-axioms]]、[[92-ax-smullyan-arithmetic]]、[[92-df-smullyan-induction]] → [[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]] → [[92-df-smullyan-sequence-code]] → [[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-correctness]]。L7 采用完整变量叶的单出现递归；N12 采用原书双层量词包装。"},{"id":"cb46b7dc65d1aa55","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LogAx}_{E,J_A},\\mathrm{MP}_{E,J_A},\\mathrm{Gen}_{E,J_A}$ 为原书无指数逻辑公理和规则，见 [[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]。"},{"id":"1af0375ea8173df2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]"}],"outgoing":["a9f2cffd9da7a09c","634d28e30ada0b29","fc67eebb6ab0c5ba","6a1ff87567369c3c"]}